    "plural.snoozes_after.few" : {
      "comment" : "Genitive of plural.snoozes under «после», form for 2-4: «после 2 откладываний». The preposition forces the genitive throughout, so this DELIBERATELY carries the many form and differs from plural.snoozes.few. Not a stale copy — do not fold the two namespaces together (#604).",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
